# Everything the image installs or builds itself
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.turbo
**/.wrangler
